      "note": [
        "District, Stockholm:  \r\n  As from year 2021, the Hägersten-Älvsjö district has been established, following a merger of the Hägersten-Liljeholmen and Älvsjö districts. The statistics for the Hägersten-Liljeholmen and Älvsjö districts are presented up to and including 2020. \r\n  As from year 2024, the Norra innerstaden district has been established, following a merger of the Norrmalm and Östermalm districts. The statistics for the Norrmalm and Östermalm districts are presented up to and including 2023. \r\n  As from year 2024, the Järva district has been established, following a merger of the Rinkeby-Kista and Spånga-Tensta districts. The statistics for the Rinkeby-Kista and Spånga-Tensta districts are presented up to and including 2023. \r\n \r\n ",
